00:00:56.100 --> 00:01:00.810
♪ The dawn piercing horn is being played by now ♪

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.930
♪ Is that a fantasy or just past memories? ♪

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:08.470
♪ Eyes wide open, but I can't tell ♪

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:12.430
♪ which side of the road am I running on ♪

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:19.810
♪ Would I know the memories and breaks mixed in morning light? ♪

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.180
♪ They said you shouldn't march on ♪

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:25.680
♪ They said you have to say goodbye ♪

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:30.180
♪ They say you can have no tomorrow but dark night ♪

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:32.810
♪ Over the finish line ♪

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:35.310
♪ I will restart my dream again ♪

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:37.100
♪ Even if it's dangerous ♪

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:42.310
♪ I will keep marching and get my crown back ♪

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:45.720
♪ Put on my armor and step to the unknown future ♪

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:50.890
♪ Hold on to my light on the road together with you ♪

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:51.970
♪ becomes the power that supports me ♪

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:55.560
♪ The morning light that burns in my heart ♪

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.930
♪ will blossom at dawn ♪

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.640
♪ Dawn of Glory on battlefield ♪

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:03.890
♪ I will show you my edge ♪

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:12.430
<b>Team Happy</b>

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:17.620
We're now at the Team Competition
between Excellent Era and Void.

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:20.040
The only ones left are the team captains.

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:22.660
And the current situation doesn't look good on Excellent Era.

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:27.910
According to their rank in the Leaderboard,
Captain Sun Xiang is under a lot of pressure.

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:30.330
One Autumn Leave got pinned down by its opponent.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:32.660
Crying Devil is trying to get a melee attack.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.450
Beautiful back attack!

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:37.290
Sun Xiang is so disappointing!

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:38.830
He basically just handed it over to Crying Devil.

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:41.290
They used to be the elite.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:42.540
They were so good.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:43.410
Chen Guo.

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:44.540
Boss!

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:45.160
I'm here.

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:46.290
Cap!

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:47.330
Is Cap here?

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:47.870
Steamed Bun?

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:48.620
Cap!

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:49.250
Over here.

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:52.450
That was fast.

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:54.200
You're the first one here.

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:55.500
Of course.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:59.750
Right after Cap asked me if I want to join,
I bought the train ticket immediately.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.200
There's a shot!

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.250
Come on!

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:03.120
What's going on here?

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.370
That's a huge crowd.

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:06.080
Someone's been messing around with you?

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:07.790
Let me sort things out for you.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:09.410
Don't do that.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:10.750
They're just watching the game.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:12.660
Right.

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:13.950
We are putting together a team.

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:15.410
We gonna play in the pro games in the future.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.830
We do have to see how others fight.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:22.120
Today it should be between

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:24.040
Excellent Era and Void?

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:28.500
These two teams, let me take a good look at them.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:30.580
One Autumn Leaf, that's your chance!

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:31.330
Hang in there!

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.200
Excellent Era's got a lot of fans.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.870
Void is not that promising.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:38.330
I think they're going down tonight.

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:39.160
Silence Boundary.

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:53.000
That is so low.

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:55.910
Got ya.

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:04.250
What the heck is Sun Xiang doing?

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:06.000
He can't even escape the Ghost Boundary?

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:07.960
Excellent Era's such a loser.

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:09.290
They can't even defeat the Void.

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:13.330
How could Excellent Era be like this?

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:19.160
Well, Excellent Era has too many flaws right now,
but no one's trying to solve any of them.

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:21.150
It's a hot mess.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:25.870
They lost again.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.290
Third from the bottom?

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.080
Only one point higher than the second last Bright Green!

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:33.870
If this continues, Excellent Era won't end well this season.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.200
Well, then they...

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.200
What's this all about?

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.040
Such a big fuss.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.210
Old Wei.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:48.120
This is nice.

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:50.900
So this is Excellent Era's old god Ye...

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:52.540
God what?

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:53.870
Don't call me Ye Qiu here.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:56.120
Call me Ye Xiu, alright?

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:58.660
You have a side account?

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.750
What are you two whispering about?

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:04.290
Nothing.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.700
Didn't get the chance to know yet, who is this lovely lady?

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:07.750
She is our boss.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:11.160
Nice to meet you!

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:12.330
I'm Wei Chen.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.250
Hello.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:14.120
Hello.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.040
My name is Chen Guo.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.250
Please go easy on me.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.170
Love me tender, love me sweet.

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:18.160
What about this beautiful lady here?

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:18.870
You're not gonna introduce us?

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:19.370
Tang Rou.

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:20.950
Fantastic name.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.540
Hello there.

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:23.520
Hello.

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:25.000
And me!

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.160
I'm Bao Rongxing.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:27.120
You can call me Steamed Bun.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:28.660
Steamed...

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:29.300
Steamed Bun.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:31.500
He's one of your team as well?

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.250
Although he is new to Glory, he is not bad at all.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.370
New to Glory?

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:43.040
I didn't come all the way here to play babysitter with you.

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:44.790
Who exactly do you have?

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.160
You don't have to worry about the roster.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.200
Two more members will be here in a few days.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:53.330
Don't lie to me.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:56.890
With my age, if I can't make it back
to the pro world next year, I'll be done.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:01.080
Let me have a look at your little net cafe team.

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:04.750
We're not gonna train in one of those booths, are we?

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:06.950
People's gonna watch and steal our infos.

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:08.660
That is not gonna happen.

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:11.080
This is the training room.

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.250
The second floor will be separated from the first floor cafe.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:14.000
It'll be an independent area.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.370
You'll not get disturbed by the customers.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.540
That's good.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:20.870
Anything else?

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:21.680
Come with me.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:25.750
This is the conference room for
tactic meetings and game reviews.

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:29.040
That's a huge projector screen.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:33.040
This is big enough to see every detail.

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:35.330
Well, what about the accommodation?

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.540
You can rest assured.

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.830
I rented a townhouse in the neighborhood as a dorm for our team.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:41.950
Let me show you there.

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.370
It's luxurious!

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:48.500
That's quite extravagant.

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:50.660
Start up team in a townhouse.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.430
Life has really changed.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.410
There are six bedrooms upstairs.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:56.370
Later when we get the whole team together,

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:57.660
you might have to share with another person with the room.

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:58.910
Sorry for the inconvenience.

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:01.410
We started from the very bottom.

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:02.660
This is not inconvenience at all.

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:04.620
I'm going to pick the room first!

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:08.200
And Old Wei, I wanna go solo with you.

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:09.950
Let me see what you can do.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:14.000
I'm the legendary former operator of Swoksaar!

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.330
I haven't tested you yet.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:16.700
And you came to challenge me?

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.330
Swoksaar?

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:20.370
What is that?

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:22.370
How come you not know?

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.620
This is the No.1 Warlock in the League!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.830
A supreme great being!

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:28.370
Yeah?

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:30.160
I'm gonna go put down my luggage.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.290
Your hardware here is not bad.

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:39.330
But I can't say the same for these online gamers you found.

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:40.870
Like that Steamed Bun.

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:42.700
I've been around the business for years.

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:43.950
I've never seen such a punk.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:45.750
That's easy.

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:47.370
We'll get everyone together tomorrow.

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:48.950
You can play with them for some games.

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:49.870
Then you'll see.

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:06.670
(Heavenly Domain Arena - Sky Abattoir)

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:08.870
Hello, everyone.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:09.870
My name is Tang Rou.

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:12.000
My account ID is Soft Mist, Battle Mage.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.080
I'm in District 10 right now.

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:15.660
I'm Wei Chen.

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:17.910
Warlock Windward Formation.

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.870
Former captain of Blue Rain.

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:21.080
And me!

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:22.410
Steamed Bun Invasion.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:28.330
Buddy, you can join in such a high-end team
because I put in a word for you with Cap.

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:29.620
Don't make me look bad, okay?

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:30.620
Get lost.

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:32.250
I am the Summoner, Concealed Light.

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:33.370
My name is Luo Ji.

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:34.120
Eighteen years old.

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:35.120
Sophomore in Mathematics.

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:37.160
I'm not that great with Glory yet.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.500
I'll definitely work harder as a team member.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.580
I'm the new Cleric Little Cold Hands.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:43.830
My name is An Wenyi.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.410
I'm also a college student.

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:49.660
A male voice under this cute female look.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:51.040
I can't get used to it no matter what.

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:52.460
Ye Xiu.

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:53.730
Lord Grim, Unspecialized.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.700
There are already six members in our Team Happy.

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:59.330
That meets the minimum headcount for a Pro Team.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.320
We will sign up for next season's Challenge.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:03.500
If we make it to the end,

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:06.500
we can enter the Pro League as professional players.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:09.000
Professional players?

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:10.200
That's cool.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:12.750
From this day on, we'll start training.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:13.950
Yes!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:18.620
Old Wei.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.000
Get on a round with Steamed Bun.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:21.290
Me?

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:21.900
Yeah.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:23.370
You two can have a little game first.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.000
Come on.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.080
We had a deal yesterday.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.080
You have no idea what you're getting into.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:32.200
Tremble under my magnificent moves!

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:40.600
I lost.

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:45.160
Didn't you want to see what I got?

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:46.620
This is what I got.

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.450
Don't be that low.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:48.540
This is a new low, even for you.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.850
Old Wei, with your level and spectrum,

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:54.830
defeated a rookie who has only played for
four months is not something to be proud of.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:55.830
You don't know shit.

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:59.290
I'm merely giving our baby a taste for
the cruelty in the professional world.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:09:59.830
All right.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.830
Just talk about his level.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:04.500
For a newbie, he's alright.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.910
But he's still like a million years away from me.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:11.330
However, he sometimes come up with these sudden moves.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.950
Most of them are monkey business.

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:17.000
But once in a while it does spook you.

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:19.950
Little Tang.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:21.500
Go have a round with Old Wei.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:22.660
Sure.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:23.330
Come on.

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:24.070
Tell me what you think.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:26.290
I won't go easy on you then.

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:28.540
Better watch out.

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:39.200
This beautiful lady is good.

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:40.700
Great at micro.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:41.700
Fast and accurate.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:43.350
The more she fights, the harder she goes.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:44.620
My hands are about to cramp.

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.870
She's only been in the game for four months.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:55.500
You found these two in the new district.

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:56.830
Impresses.

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:58.220
Yeah.

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:00.080
They are diamonds in the rough.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:01.000
Nice.

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:05.540
Sis, why don't we just stop?

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:07.160
It's just a try-out.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:10.250
My HP is turning red all of a sudden.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:13.160
The cruel professional world don't take try-outs.

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:14.040
Just end the game.

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:15.580
Try play with them in a team.

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.080
I'm a sparring partner or what?

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.540
This Concealed Light is just so so.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.620
Our lady boss can do it better.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:32.790
Yeah.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.750
But he is a top student in mathematics.

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:38.370
For games, Mathematics is a very important subject.

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.660
Considering that, he is more than promising.

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:50.200
This Cleric got a great sense in timing.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:51.040
Of course.

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:54.370
I went through a lot to get him from Tyranny.

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:55.910
Tyranny?

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:59.160
You went undermine your old enemy Tyranny?

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:00.660
That's dope.

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:02.700
It's hard to find a good player in online game.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.200
Little Hands is outstanding in seizing opportunities.

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.410
He just needs to work on his micro.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:08.830
OK.

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:10.450
The roster might be OK.

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:12.410
But to win the Challenge?

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:13.080
This is gonna be tricky.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:14.830
We have to do like tons of practice.

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:17.700
You think we can get those professional training software?

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:18.750
No need to.

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.660
I picked some maps from Glory.

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:22.660
They can be as good as those training software.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:24.580
Are you sure?

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:25.660
No kidding.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:26.750
What do you think?

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:28.450
Think about the first season.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:30.080
That's how you and I trained.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:31.160
OK.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.290
In the Challenge, we'll only bump
into fall-out Pro Teams at most.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:36.290
I can finish them like a million times.

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:39.700
But our new members don't have enough experience.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.370
They have potentials as well.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:44.750
Those pros have no infos on them.

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:46.870
They can be our secret weapon.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:50.040
Old Ye, our guild is lousy.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:53.370
That tiny bit of rare materials are
not even enough for your umbrella.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.620
We're developing fast in District 10.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.660
After we establish our foundations in Heavily Domain,

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:59.500
the material supply will come up.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.870
Our equipments won't match up with professional clubs.

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:03.620
We don't have enough silver weapons.

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:05.700
That's what you and I have to do.

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:06.700
What?

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:10.700
You're afraid your self-made equipments are no
match with the Pro Teams' tech department?

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:13.080
Afraid of them?

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:16.540
When I made my Death Hand,
they were still playing with mud.

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:22.200
But judging from what you've said, we might have a shot.

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:25.330
The average teams are not even qualified to be our opponent.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:29.040
We can definitely ace the Challenge and get back to the League.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.660
You're satisfied with just a Challenge champion?

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:37.290
Happy's goal is the season's champion in Pro League.

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:39.830
Kiddo, you're talking big.

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:43.170
You believe god of Glory would just shine on you like that?

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.000
God of Glory?

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:46.090
Who is that?

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:47.870
It's you, alright?

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:48.750
Now get lost.

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:58.100
The King's Avatar 2

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:01.540
The final game of season 8 is about to start.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:04.080
Regular season ranking has basically settled.

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:06.830
Right now, the first place goes to Blue Rain.

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:11.330
In the last five rounds, Blue Rain performed
great with their consistent stability.

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:13.750
The second is Samsara.

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:15.330
They've been quite aggressive in this season.

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:17.250
Only five points away from Blue Rain.

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:20.700
Tiny Herb and Tyranny, these two old elite teams

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.700
rank the third and fourth with no surprise.

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:28.160
Last year's champion Tiny Herb
is wildly supported by the audience.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.410
After that, Misty Rain No.5.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:32.870
Void No.6.

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.370
Thunderclap in No.7

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:36.380
will go into the playoffs for sure.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:41.330
The last seat will land on either
Team Howling or Team 301 Degrees.

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:43.370
In addition to the said teams,

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:47.450
the once elite Excellent Era is under
concern for their current situation.

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:52.040
Sun Xiang, don't go too fast.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.580
I can't cover you with my range.

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:55.370
Liu Hao!

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.040
What the heck you're doing?

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:57.160
Come cover me!

00:14:58.450 --> 00:14:59.290
Where the heck is Cleric?

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:00.410
Heal me!

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:07.500
Excellent Era, a once triple-crowned team

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:08.950
which started their own dynasty,

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:12.450
is determined to fall out in this season.

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:14.700
They now rank as the second last.

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:16.660
A position that will definitely throw them out the League.

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:19.870
You can't help but wonder, why is this happening?

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:22.700
Can they really survive from the current dilemma?

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:25.200
Get this clear, I'm the captain!

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.160
Not you!

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:27.270
Sun Xiang.

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:28.470
Can you come here for a second?

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.160
It is said,

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:43.910
Excellent Era's new player Sun Xiang,

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:47.160
will not attend the rest of this season's
games due to his physical conditions.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:49.120
Manager Cui, is that true?

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:54.660
Sun Xiang has been having physical problems long ago.

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:59.410
He insists staying in the game due
to Excellent Era's current situations.

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:03.910
And now it's time for him to stop.

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:05.410
Meanwhile...

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:07.450
Sun Xiang is ill?

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:08.660
That's nonsense.

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:11.200
He looked fine in the Western Wildness.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:13.790
Banning their own main force at this critical moment?

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:14.950
What are they thinking about?

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:18.450
In that case, maybe the team is really out of control.

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:19.250
Why?

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.120
When a team is in trouble,

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:26.350
the most logical approach is to work
together and get out of dilemma.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.620
But look at Excellent Era now.

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:31.580
During the game, their priority is to show-off.

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:32.910
Like Liu Hao.

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:34.870
He only paid attention to his personal performance.

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.620
He didn't care about the team.

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:40.160
In that case, he could secure a good future after the transfer.

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:43.830
That being said, he saw the team as Titanic.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:45.290
He's ready to abandon ship.

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:48.410
A team like this, will only get worse and worse.

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:53.330
If they fall out, they can use Sun Xiang's vacancy as an excuse.

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:55.750
That's a part of it.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.790
If they can get the qualification without Sun Xiang,

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.250
that's an even better story.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.370
Even if they're out,

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:04.250
when Sun Xiang comes back in the future,

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.870
he will still be the hope of their fans.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:07.950
As long as they have fans who still want them,

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:09.910
Excellent Era can continue.

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:11.450
At the end of the day,

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:14.910
everything they did was about keeping fans.

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:16.410
Whatever happens,

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:18.750
they have to let their fans have hope.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.410
All those plots.

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:23.790
Forget about them.

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:25.580
Let's go back to our training.

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:27.040
We'll see when the season's over.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:42.250
♪ In the near or far future ♪

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.920
♪ What kind of adventure we will bump into?♪

00:17:45.450 --> 00:17:48.300
♪ The once blossomed past ♪

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:51.270
♪ calm or startle others ♪

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:54.170
♪ We've all been laughed at before ♪

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:56.620
♪ Got laughter and tears at our fingertips ♪

00:17:57.270 --> 00:17:59.850
♪ When get into Glory ♪

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.600
♪ the applause are what we're here for ♪

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:05.450
♪ So lucky to have you with me ♪

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:08.450
♪ You make me full of courage ♪

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:12.050
♪ Your determined silhouette ♪

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:14.470
♪ is what drives me forward ♪

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:17.400
♪ Thinking of you, knowing our dream won't be that far ♪

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:20.490
♪ As long as I open my eyes ♪

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:21.830
Fantastic!

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:26.200
We are officially registered for the Challenge!

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:28.580
The League has sent us the instructions.

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:30.690
It's going well.

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:31.950
Great.

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:33.080
I've been looking forward to this.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:34.450
It's amazing.

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:35.450
What time is the match?

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:37.080
It's still early.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:38.160
It's going to be the summer

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:39.950
when the regular season starts.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.910
But I can't wait!

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:45.700
I feel like I'm on fire!

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:48.870
Young people should have such fighting spirit.

00:18:49.910 --> 00:18:51.080
Today is a great day.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.700
I'm paying for dinner.

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:55.580
Boss is buying!

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:58.910
Dinner! Dinner!

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:00.410
How on earth can they have the nerves for it?

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:01.800
Excellent Era's performance is not worth the time

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:02.620
of the press conference.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.040
We are having some problems right now.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:06.700
But it won't be the end of our days.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:08.410
I'll be with Excellent Era,

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:10.040
and walk through the difficult times.

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.330
Next season's Challenge,

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:15.410
I will come back with Excellent Era!

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:19.330
The once triple-crowned Excellent Era

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:22.160
didn't make it to the post-season finals in season 8.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:25.540
Meanwhile, ranked 19th in all 20 teams,

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:29.160
means they will be one of the two fall-out teams this year,

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:30.700
disqualified to stay in the Pro League.

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:33.080
Excellent Era is really out.

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:34.830
In order to get back to the League,

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:37.350
they have to nail it in the Challenge next year.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:44.000
Excellent Era is really out of the game.

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:46.700
Then they'll run into us at the Challenge.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.370
That's not good.

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.620
Challenge with Excellent Era.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.540
The most difficult Easter in history.

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:56.040
You think they know you're getting a team

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:57.750
and have to start from the Challenge,

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:00.830
so they deliberately get down to
the Challenge to go against you?

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:02.200
I don't think so.

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:03.830
I'm not that important to them.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:09.910
Anyway next season, Excellent Era will have big moves.

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:12.490
What do you mean?

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:15.250
They messed up this season already.

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:16.700
If they don't take actions for the next season,

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:18.580
they will be done for good.

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:22.660
You mean Excellent Era will only be stronger in the Challenge,

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:23.450
and even more terrifying?

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:26.290
Then if we really bump into them,

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:29.120
the Challenge won't be where our dreams starts,

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.000
it'll be where our dreams ends.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:34.040
What if we beat Excellent Era in the Challenge?

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:36.750
Will that be the finale for Excellent Era?

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.540
Eliminate Excellent Era?

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:44.200
Are you going to bury the dynasty you created?

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:47.750
What do you mean "I'm going to"?

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:49.790
If we bump into them,

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:52.700
we just have to slay them with all we can.

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:54.330
That's what it takes to be a Pro.

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:55.290
Exactly.

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:56.500
We ain't afraid of them!

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:57.450
That's right!

00:20:57.450 --> 00:20:59.750
Happy, ace at the Challenge!

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:01.540
Come on.

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:03.820
(Restaurant Prosper)

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.080
Mr. Tao.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:09.870
Banning Sun Xiang was such a great move.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:12.290
Today's press conference,

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:13.660
as soon as Sun Xiang came out,

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:16.160
the fans immediately got pacified.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:19.620
And they all look forward to our return in the Easter.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:23.870
But Mr. Tao, what should we do after this?

00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:25.950
There's nothing to worry about in the Easter,

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:27.910
but now our team...

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:31.290
The contract we've been approaching should be back tonight.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.580
It's confirmed?

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:39.040
That's really good.

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:42.450
By the way, Mr. Tao, I also heard a funny thing.

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:45.750
Ye Qiu put up a team in that net cafe.

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:47.450
And even signed up for the Challenge.

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:52.330
That crappy team, I wonder if they
can even make it to the first round.

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:54.040
Come on in.

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:56.500
I'll get the seat.

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:58.330
Barbecue!

00:22:01.950 --> 00:22:02.830
What a coincidence.

00:22:02.830 --> 00:22:04.160
Didn't expect to see you here.

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:09.330
It's a coincidence.

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:10.540
You are here...?

00:22:10.750 --> 00:22:12.200
For dinner, of course.

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:15.000
What is Excellent Era doing here?

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:17.330
So you are Excellent Era.

00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:18.750
Steamed Bun!

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:22.000
Are you gonna also be in the Challenge later?

00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:24.250
Nice.

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:25.910
You've been beaten hard.

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:26.870
Gotta work better.

00:22:27.250 --> 00:22:27.750
You!

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:29.660
See if you can catch up with us.

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:36.540
Steamed Bun, come sit here.

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:39.750
Would you like to join us?

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:41.120
We got plenty of seats here.

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:43.330
That's OK.

00:22:44.320 --> 00:22:46.860
This is the roster you found?

00:22:48.790 --> 00:22:49.620
Yeah.

00:22:53.040 --> 00:22:55.160
You have a special eye for people.

00:22:55.870 --> 00:22:56.660
Enjoy your dinner.

00:22:57.040 --> 00:22:57.950
I'll go first.

00:23:03.620 --> 00:23:05.000
Who are they?

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:06.950
Boss of Excellent Era, Tao Xuan and his manager.

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:09.330
We bumped into them?

00:23:10.870 --> 00:23:13.200
You think Excellent Era will try to sabotage us?

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:15.370
For example, while our team is not mature enough,

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:17.910
put us together with them in the first round?

00:23:17.910 --> 00:23:21.040
They've been the elite club for the past eight years.

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:22.450
They can eat us for breakfast.

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:25.870
Well, I can ask him for you.

00:23:26.290 --> 00:23:27.040
Give me your phone.

00:23:29.120 --> 00:23:33.160
Mr. Tao, you think that guy is really
dumb or is he pretending to be?

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:35.450
And that Ye Qiu.

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:38.500
Don't know where he found all these weirdos.

00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:39.580
Back to Excellent Era.

00:23:41.540 --> 00:23:43.040
(Text from unknown number)
Sure.

00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:44.370
Just found something interesting.

00:23:44.870 --> 00:23:46.700
Somebody's still using text messages nowadays.

00:23:47.500 --> 00:23:48.950
Who would that be?

00:23:50.080 --> 00:23:51.950
You think we'll bump into each other in the first game?

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:55.000
It's an old acquaintance of mine.

00:23:56.290 --> 00:23:57.160
Got cold feet?

00:23:57.500 --> 00:23:58.450
Are you afraid of me?

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:01.120
Afraid of you?

00:24:01.750 --> 00:24:03.290
Give me a reason to be afraid of you.

00:24:03.290 --> 00:24:04.790
You don't need reasons for that.

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:06.620
Everyone in Glory is afraid of me.

00:24:06.620 --> 00:24:07.790
It's common sense.

00:24:13.580 --> 00:24:14.870
I can't stand it!

00:24:14.870 --> 00:24:16.080
You gotta check this out.

00:24:16.080 --> 00:24:17.790
This is so very shameless.

00:24:18.000 --> 00:24:18.830
I'm just telling the truth.

00:24:20.080 --> 00:24:21.410
Maybe it was so in the past.

00:24:22.080 --> 00:24:22.700
But now?

00:24:22.700 --> 00:24:25.370
Now, you might as well do some
random interviews in the game.

00:24:25.910 --> 00:24:28.040
In District 10 or Heavily Domain.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:32.290
Play your talents in online game.

00:24:32.290 --> 00:24:33.540
Not bad.
(Happy Net Cafe)

00:24:34.910 --> 00:24:38.500
You want me to set you up in Excellent Dynasty's guild?

00:24:39.120 --> 00:24:40.020
That's not necessary.

00:24:40.910 --> 00:24:42.790
You should better focus at your Excellent Dynasty.

00:24:43.250 --> 00:24:44.500
Before you go bankrupt.

00:24:45.120 --> 00:24:46.200
You really think you can do that?

00:24:46.520 --> 00:24:47.850
Go ask Chen Yehui.

00:24:48.330 --> 00:24:49.200
He got so scared.

00:24:50.000 --> 00:24:51.000
Save the talk.

00:24:51.580 --> 00:24:53.250
I'll see you in the game.

00:24:53.660 --> 00:24:54.410
Good.

00:24:54.870 --> 00:24:57.450
It seems that a part of you hasn't changed after all.

00:24:58.100 --> 00:25:00.830
When it comes to game, only the numbers matter.

00:25:02.160 --> 00:25:06.080
You better pray not to bump into us in the first round.

00:25:07.620 --> 00:25:08.580
Will do.

00:25:11.200 --> 00:25:12.200
See you in the game.

00:25:13.040 --> 00:25:13.910
See you in the game.

00:25:14.580 --> 00:25:15.870
How about it?

00:25:15.870 --> 00:25:17.160
Did you get anything?

00:25:18.000 --> 00:25:18.950
We'll see them in the game.

00:25:19.370 --> 00:25:20.250
Go away.

00:25:20.250 --> 00:25:22.160
I mean, did you get anything out of them?

00:25:23.080 --> 00:25:24.290
He's not gonna play dirty.

00:25:24.620 --> 00:25:28.080
The game will be only about the win of lose on the field.

00:25:29.660 --> 00:25:30.790
Are you sure?

00:25:31.910 --> 00:25:33.790
After all, I've known him for so many years.

00:25:35.540 --> 00:25:37.870
Although our pursuits have changed.

00:25:38.750 --> 00:25:42.040
But there are some basic principles
that will always stay the same.

00:25:43.290 --> 00:25:43.950
Mr. Tao.

00:25:45.080 --> 00:25:45.660
Mr. Tao?

00:25:47.750 --> 00:25:51.950
Didn't expect Ye Qiu to go against us in the game after he left.

00:25:52.620 --> 00:25:53.660
That's good.

00:25:54.290 --> 00:25:57.200
Such an Easter will be much more interesting.

00:26:02.790 --> 00:26:03.620
Check this out.

00:26:07.250 --> 00:26:08.700
This contract is...?

00:26:10.540 --> 00:26:12.370
He said yes to this transfer so fast?

00:26:12.950 --> 00:26:14.910
Glory's No.1 Mechanic.

00:26:14.910 --> 00:26:16.950
One of the four Tactical Masters.

00:26:17.290 --> 00:26:19.470
With him, Excellent Era will be back to the top in no time.

00:26:19.470 --> 00:26:21.910
(Xiao Shiqin, Life Extinguisher)

00:26:23.200 --> 00:26:24.270
What's been taken away from us.

00:26:24.270 --> 00:26:25.660
(Excellent Era)

00:26:25.660 --> 00:26:27.950
Sooner or later, we'll take them back.

00:26:28.250 --> 00:26:29.900
(Happy Net Cafe)

00:27:01.310 --> 00:27:04.430
♪ If you can't see the sky with your head up ♪

00:27:05.520 --> 00:27:09.560
♪ Then look down and focus on where you're heading ♪

00:27:09.810 --> 00:27:14.390
♪ We all know that we don't want to bury our dreams ♪

00:27:14.390 --> 00:27:16.560
♪ Step back for the next take-off ♪

00:27:18.970 --> 00:27:21.180
♪ All channels are reconnected ♪

00:27:21.520 --> 00:27:23.140
♪ I remember you said you would wait ♪

